    "text": "The negation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equivalent to"
